" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>